 mean the  return of an old character coming from a  report from the Illuminati com who were  the people who reported that Christian  Bale was going to be in Thor love and  thunder and also playing a villain they  reported yesterday that a casting call  for Thor 4 reveals an open role for a  supporting lead character named Zappa  Marvel Studios is searching for a young  black male between 11 and 12 years old  either african-american or black British  it also lists him as intelligent  fearless mature with a good sense of  humor  now while the name Zappa doesn't really  bring anybody to mind immediately from  Marvel Comics it's actually widely  believed right now that this is going to  be somebody a very significant import  tense and although we aren't 100% sure  of who this character is actually going  to be in Thor love and thunder we have  an idea the current theory right now  based off of the description for the  character being cast is that this could  actually be a reincarnated Heimdall  to many people's surprise Heimdall  actually died in Avengers infinity war  he played a pretty big role in for  Ragnarok and a lot of people thought he  was going to be in the MCU for a pretty  long time but I just Alba probably isn't  coming back to the MCU to play his  character since he died however a big  part of Thor and Asgardian theology is  death and rebirth in for Ragnarok hella  the goddess of death came and Asgard was  destroyed so we essentially saw the  death of Asgard and then Thanos came and  wiped out half of the Asgardians  but now Asgard has found a new home on  earth so it could be that in Thor love  and thunder we're going to explore the  rebirth of Asgard and the Asgardians  just a theory for now but we do know  that Thor love and thunder is going to  be a crazy movie in fact Chris Hemsworth  has recently read the script for Thor  love and thunder and while speaking with  the Philadelphia Inquirer he said it's  one of the best scripts I've read in  years  it